 3359|  18.4k|{
 3360|       |    /* We cannot really resolve links here as for that we would need
 3361|       |     * more context. E.g. a following pair of brackets (reference link),
 3362|       |     * or enclosing pair of brackets (if the inner is the link, the outer
 3363|       |     * one cannot be.)
 3364|       |     *
 3365|       |     * Therefore we here only construct a list of '[' ']' pairs ordered by
 3366|       |     * position of the closer. This allows us to analyze what is or is not
 3367|       |     * link in the right order, from inside to outside in case of nested
 3368|       |     * brackets.
 3369|       |     *
 3370|       |     * The resolving itself is deferred to md_resolve_links().
 3371|       |     */
 3372|       |
